### Summary of what changed:
* **Earliest Submission Kept:** In Step 5, `hasNewer` was swapped to `hasEarlier` (`other.tsMs < item.tsMs`, breaking ties with `other.rawIndex < item.rawIndex`). In your Maya Singh example, Row 1 will now have a blank `Flag_Superseded` (kept), and Row 2 will be marked `SUPERSEDED`.
* **Phone Formatting & `Settings!B1`:** Step 0 checks if a `Settings` tab exists and grabs `B1`. If `B1` contains a 3-digit number, any 7-digit phone number gets those 3 digits prepended. All valid 10-digit numbers are now formatted cleanly as `(123) 456-7890`.
* **`CleaningSummary` Tab:** Built in Step 7, it calculates all 4 top-level metrics plus a breakdown of every canonical park name (alphabetized, with unmapped `REVIEW` parks grouped at the bottom of the table so you can easily see how many are left to map).

